 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well, they came on to me really hard. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So we fucked."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And then he promised to come back "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["after he was done bathing."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well, he can't right now. We're busy."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sorry girls."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Mmh, we're not really asking. We know "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["all about you \\n[1], Yuuka wants "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to keep you busy while she works."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So we're going to help her!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 301, "parameters": [0, 104, false, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 601, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Itai!\\. You didn't need to be so rough!\\."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 117, "parameters": [42]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well, sounds like we kept you busy enough "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["anyway. So I'm sure Yuuka will still "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["reward us!\\."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Wait, what was that noise?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hmm? It's a clock, duh. Everyone is "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["preparing for the ceremony right now."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The ceremony...Yuuka mentioned that."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What is it?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [3, 3, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The many tailed one will descend upon "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["this earth and inhabit the chosen body. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The preparations are almost complete, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["so you only have to wait a little longer!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The chosen-\\.Fera?!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Oh, you knew already? Well that makes "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["things easier. You'll see her soon, once "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the ceremony is complete. Once the fifth"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["gong tolls."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 3", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I think we've kept you as long as we "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["can, so we'll be going now. Bye bye "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Onii-chan."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 122, "parameters": [131, 131, 0, 0, 3]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sounds like we really are on a time "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["limit. We need to find out where this "